sequenceDiagram
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant GIT as Git Tags
    participant IMAP as IMAP服务器
    
    Note over GH: Run #1
    GH->>GIT: 读取标签 "lastid"
    GIT-->>GH: 空（首次运行）
    GH->>IMAP: fetch mails 1-50
    IMAP-->>GH: 50 mails
    GH->>GIT: push tag "lastid" = 50
    
    Note over GH: Run #2
    GH->>GIT: 读取标签 "lastid"
    GIT-->>GH: 50
    GH->>IMAP: fetch mails 51-73
    IMAP-->>GH: 23 mails
    GH->>GIT: push tag "lastid" = 73